he paper “Attention Is All You Need” adds Positional Encoding.

👉 This means:

We add some numbers to each word to tell the model its position.

Positional Encoding:
PE(pos, 2i) = sin(pos / 10000^(2i / d_model)) (for even dimensions)
PE(pos, 2i+1) = cos(pos / 10000^(2i / d_model)) (for odd dimensions)